      "content": "an exit strategy... it sounds so much more peaceful than what's coming for us. i've just been sitting here staring at the dark, thinking about how much easier it would be to just... be done with the waiting. how does someone even find that \"clean release\" you mean? how do you make it feel like an act of peace instead of just something terrible?",
